METHOD ATTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The prompt-engineering toolkit, the hypershot technique, and the framing of
self-play as an AlphaGo-shaped search over text are the work of Matthew Murphy
(https://github.com/gusthemole), published as the Lexideck prompt engineering
curriculum. This repository applies that method to clean-room evaluation of
LLM-assisted features and records what running it produced. The method is his;
the application and the record are ours.

